---
layout: base
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ site.title }}</h1>
    <div class="hero-logo">
      {% include "logo.svg" %}
    </div>
    <p class="hero-tagline">Software built with care&mdash;simple, solid, and made to last.</p>
    <div class="button-group">
      <a href="#products" class="button">See what we're building</a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="button button-outline">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-glow" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">About</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Software built with intention</h2>
    <p>Cereal Syndicate is a software studio founded by a designer and developer with over 20 years of experience. We build thoughtful, well-crafted apps&mdash;no ads, no data harvesting, no dark patterns. Just honest software that does its job well.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="products">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">Products</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading">What we're building</h2>
    <div class="product-card">
      <div class="product-badge">
        <span class="product-badge-dot"></span>
        In Development
      </div>
      <h3 class="visually-hidden">Mini Cast</h3>
      <div class="product-logo">
        {% include "icon-minicast.svg" %}
      </div>
      <p>A podcast app that gives kids real autonomy&mdash;they browse, choose, and listen independently within a library their parents have hand-picked. No algorithms deciding what's next, no endless rabbit holes. Just kids in the driver's seat, inside boundaries you set.</p>
      <div class="product-features">
        <div class="product-feature">
          <div class="product-feature-icon">{% include "icon-users.svg" %}</div>
          <p><strong>Parent-curated</strong>Parents choose the shows. Kids explore freely within that library.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-feature">
          <div class="product-feature-icon">{% include "icon-shield-check.svg" %}</div>
          <p><strong>Private by design</strong>No social features, no tracking, no ads. Each child gets their own space.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-feature">
          <div class="product-feature-icon">{% include "icon-star.svg" %}</div>
          <p><strong>Made for kids</strong>Simple navigation, personal favorites, and a persistent player designed for small hands.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://minicast.co" class="button button-outline">Join the Mini Cast beta</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
